---
title: Implementation Attempt · a draft finished before the answer, one gate approval, a swap, full checks
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant voice as Voice agent
  participant gate as Implementation Gate
  participant cp as Implementation controller
  box Vercel Sandbox · prepared workspace
    participant codex as Codex · GPT-6.1 Sol
    participant ws as Workspace checkout
  end
  participant spare as Spare candidate runtime

  cp->>codex: intake draft · the original request + investigation findings
  cp->>spare: build the intake draft for production
  voice->>cp: proposal mark · proposed change + checks
  par The gate prepares its evaluation
    cp->>gate: confirm the flow · propose over the predicted bundle
  and The draft adjusts to the proposal
    cp->>codex: codex exec · adjust the draft to exactly the proposal
    codex->>ws: scoped search, exact reads, bounded edits
  end
  cp->>ws: format, stage, and diff the draft
  par Finish the candidate before the answer
    cp->>ws: incremental type check
  and
    cp->>spare: rebuild what changed · follow the schema · render check · readiness
  end
  Note over ws,spare: Prepared, not authorized: nothing is routed.
  voice->>gate: record_acceptance_criteria · the change as proposed
  gate->>cp: approved_live · the prepared proposal, when nothing changed
  cp->>cp: adopt the recorded draft · scope check against the frozen scope
  cp->>spare: publish the Preview Version from the draft's record · switch the route
  cp->>ws: confirm the published tree · full checks · lint and tests
  opt A full check fails
    cp-->>codex: correction cycle · its version swaps in from the next spare runtime
  end
  cp->>ws: hand the workspace over · the next change drafts from this version
